{title: Ye Jo Halka Halka}
{artist: Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Ye jo halka halka sa [C]suroor hai,        [Am]Teri ik nazar ka [C]kasoor hai
Ke [F]Sharab peena [C]sikha dia,        [Am]Mere hamnawa mere [C]pyaar sun tere
[Am]pyar ki hai ye [C]kaisi dhunn,        Mujhe [F]kissi pe marna [C]sikha dia
Ho mujhe [F]kissi pe marna [C]sikha dia,        [Am]Ye jo halka halka sa [C]suroor hai
[Am]Teri ik nazar ka [C]kasoor hai,        Ke [F]Sharab peena [C]sikha dia
